  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Two Truths and a Lie\r\n\r\nIn the warm up, the AI wrote two truths and a lie — and your class couldn't \r\nagree on which was which. Time to find out who was right.\r\n\r\nThis is the same AI chatbot that wrote the two truths and a lie statements from the warm up. Time to find out who was right.\r\n\r\n##### PART 1: Ask the bot\r\n1. Ask the chatbot questions about octopuses, including questions that could help you figure out which statement was the lie.\r\n2. Pay attention to its answers. Are they specific? Could you use them to prove which statement is false?\r\n\r\n##### PART 2: Give the bot the facts\r\n3. Click \"Add file\" → \"From Library\" and attach the [DOCUMENT NAME] file.\r\n4. Ask your questions again — this time, tell the bot to refer to the attached document.\r\n5. Figure it out: Which statement was the lie? \r\n\r\n##### Talk with your partner: \r\nThe bot didn't change — so why are its answers \r\nso different now?\r\n",
    "aichat_settings": {
      "initialCustomizations": {
        "selectedModelId": "gen-ai-mistral-7b-inst-v01",
